	<DATAIO_INFO>
		<TRID_INFO>
			<TRAN tranid="obaci_nmet_012a" trcode="obaci_nmet_012a" compress="1" encryption="1" inputcheck="1" useattr="0" />
			<TRAN tranid="obcsb_nmet_101a" trcode="obcsb_nmet_101a" compress="1" encryption="1" inputcheck="1" useattr="0" />
			<TRAN tranid="obtss_opnf_101a" trcode="obtss_opnf_101a" compress="1" encryption="1" inputcheck="1" useattr="0" />
		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obaci_nmet_012a" title="비대면업무_1원이체 검증 및 오류" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="301" _ulen="221" >

PROS_CLS_CODE^처리구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
REG_UNIQ_NO^등록고유번호^13^0^0^0^0^0^0
REG_SRNO^등록일련번호^11^0^7^0^0^0^0
